Description: High-performance automatic speech recognition (ASR) library and tools
 whisper.cpp is a high-performance inference of OpenAI's Whisper automatic
 speech recognition (ASR) model.
 .
 This package includes:
  - libwhisper shared library
  - whisper-cli command-line tool
  - whisper-server HTTP server
  - whisper-worker WebSocket worker (C++ and Rust versions)
  - whisper-bench benchmarking tool
  - whisper-stream streaming tool
  - whisper-command command tool
  - whisper-system-info system information tool
  - whisper-vad-speech-segments VAD tool
  - quantize quantization tool

